   np.round[0.5, 1.5, 2.5, 3.5, -0.5, -1.5, -2.5, 4.5, 5.5, 0.0] = [0.0, 2.0, 2.0, 4.0, -0.0, -2.0, -2.0, 4.0, 6.0, 0.0]
ok   round: exact binary halves round half to even ("1.5 and 2.5 round to 2.0, -0.5 and 0.5 round to 0.0")
