---- astype all pairs at boundary values
   121 dtype pairs; 461 exactly representable values, 66 int->int wrap cases, 84 in-range float->int truncations; mismatches []
ok   astype: exactly representable boundary values are preserved for every (src, dst) pair
ok   astype int -> narrower int wraps modulo 2**bits (C conversion), for every pair
ok   astype int -> float rounds to nearest (int64 max -> 2**63 in float64 and float32), float -> narrower float rounds to nearest or overflows to inf
ok   astype float -> int in range truncates toward zero for every pair
ok   int64 max -> float64 is 9223372036854775808.0 (not exactly representable; recorded, rounds up)
ok   uint64 max -> int64 wraps to -1; int64 -1 -> uint64 is 2**64-1; int8 -1 -> uint8 255
ok   float64 -> float16: 65520 rounds to inf (above the midpoint to 65504+32), 1e-8 -> subnormal 1.1920929e-07 * ... rounding to nearest float16
ok   bool <-> numeric: astype(bool) is nonzero test (nan -> True, -0.0 -> False); True -> 1
ok   astype(complex) then back: float64 -> complex128 -> float64 round trip; complex -> float discards imag with ComplexWarning
