ok   spacing(-1) = -eps (signed toward larger magnitude), spacing(inf) = nan, spacing(nan) = nan, spacing(2**k) = 2**(k-52)
ok   spacing(x) == nextafter(x, inf) - x for random positive x; float32 spacing(1f) = 2^-23; float16 spacing(1h) = 2^-10
ok   spacing(x) == 0 never for finite x; 'there should not be any representable number between x + spacing(x) and x'
